 like**\r\n\r\nI think the best solution for this is to configure the text used to send invitations out via SiteConfig.\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\n\r\nUsing generalisation in the code base but I think an invitation needs to be more personal from the originating Forem\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nCurrent mail content looks like this\r\n\r\n```text\r\nUSER ID: #143 - alexjordyssiri_390 ID 283 TOKEN\r\nowhJ4HycRiwkXRqHSBNqjnVrn6mcFLca\r\nTO\r\nsomeone@hotmail.com\r\nMAILER\r\nDevise::Mailer#invitation_instructions\r\nSUBJECT\r\nInvitation instructions\r\nCONTENT\r\nDate: Tue, 18 Aug 2020 09:40:56 +0000\r\nFrom: thisMMAlife <yo@thismmalife.com>\r\nReply-To: thisMMAlife <yo@thismmalife.com>\r\nTo: someone@hotmail.com\r\nMessage-ID: <5f3ba22844a00_e3304f87726b@c6656b56-eae8-4d80-8739-703718ad78ea.mail>\r\nSubject: Invitation instructions\r\nMime-Version: 1.0\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative;\r\n boundary=\"--==_mimepart_5f3ba228416a5_e3304f87715b\";\r\n charset=UTF-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit\r\n\r\n\r\n----==_mimepart_5f3ba228416a5_e3304f87715b\r\nContent-Type: text/plain;\r\n charset=UTF-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit\r\n\r\nHello someone@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nSomeone has invited you to https://www.thismmalife.com/, you can accept it through the link below.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.thismmalife.com/users/invitation/accept?invitation_token=t7NuudiqB7ea5nTPQ_Xq\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you don't want to accept the invitation, please ignore this email. Your account won't be created until you access the link above and set your password.\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/9849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/9849/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3889380261,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmV